#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:2
msgid "引言：因为山在那里"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:4
msgid "1924 年，登山家乔治·马洛里被问到：\"为什么要登珠峰？\" 他答：**\"因为山在那里。\"**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:6
msgid "深度学习面前也有一座山。一座没有山顶的山——**完美的泛化**。无论投入多少算力、数据、层数，我们永远在接近，永远到不了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:8
msgid "那为什么还要攀登？因为每一个\"爬不上去\"的困境，都逼出了一个新的设计。**攀登本身，就是理解的过程。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:10
msgid "这一章不是百科全书"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:13
msgid "这一章讲的不是\"CNN有哪些层\"或\"ResNet有几条连接\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:15
msgid "这一章讲的是：一群人如何从**赤手空拳**出发，一步步发现更好的工具、更聪明的路线、更可靠的生存法则——直到站在离山顶最近的地方，回望来路，然后把旗帜递给下一个人。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:17
msgid "**每一个架构都不是凭空设计的。每一个突破都是对前一代\"为什么摔倒\"的深刻回应。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "已经熟悉 CNN？这里有快速路线"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:23
msgid "这一章非常长——占全书约 40%。如果你已经了解卷积、池化、LeNet 这些基础，不需要从头爬练习峰。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:25
msgid "**推荐路线**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"快速扫一遍 {doc}`登山上篇的引言 <practice-peak/introduction>`，重点看 {ref}`inductive-"
"bias`——它回答了\"为什么 CNN 比全连接更适合图像\"，是整个上篇的核心洞察"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid "翻翻 {doc}`消融研究 <ablation-study/index>`——拆开装备、验证每个组件的贡献，这套方法论在任何实验中都有用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:28
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"主力时间花在 {doc}`登山下篇 <image-net-"
"era/index>`——AlexNet、Inception、ResNet、MobileNet、EfficientNet，每一个都是对前代\"为什么摔倒\"的回应"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:29
#, python-brace-format
msgid "收尾读 {doc}`架构心法 <model-architecture-design/index>`——把具体技术升维为设计原则"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:31
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**可以跳过**：{doc}`全连接：赤手空拳 <practice-peak/fc-layer-basics>`、{doc}`卷积：发现装备 "
"<practice-peak/cnn-basics>`、{doc}`数据准备：打包行囊 <practice-peak/dataset-"
"preparation>`（除非你想复习 MNIST 数据管线的细节）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:36
msgid "两座山"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
#, python-brace-format
msgid "🏔️ {doc}`登山上篇 <practice-peak/index>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
#, python-brace-format
msgid "⛰️ {doc}`登山下篇 <image-net-era/index>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "MNIST：练习峰"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "ImageNet：真正的未登峰"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "赤手空拳 → 发现装备 → 首登"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "AlexNet首登 → 多尺度 → 高原反应 → 聚焦 → 预算学"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "**学会攀登**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:20
msgid "**征服极限**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:44
msgid "**上篇**，从赤手空拳出发，一步步发现冰镐和绳索，学会打包行囊、遵守纪律，完成第一次登顶。**每一章都是对前一章\"为什么爬不上去\"的回应。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:46
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这背后的核心原理是 {ref}`inductive-bias`——把山的结构刻进装备里。全连接不看山体，20 万参数走不远；CNN "
"顺应山体，几百个参数就能爬更高。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"两座山之间，{doc}`消融研究 <ablation-study/index>` "
"拆开装备——不是破坏，是理解。把卷积层拆掉会跌多少？换掉激活函数呢？每个零件到底贡献了多少？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:50
msgid ""
"**下篇**，换一座真正的山。ImageNet 比 MNIST 大 1,000 倍。AlexNet 在 2012 年首登成功——错误率从 28% "
"砸到 "
"15%。此后八年：多尺度工具、高原反应补给站、学会聚焦的注意力、预算有限时的精打细算。练习峰教会了你**怎么爬**，登山下篇教会你**在真正的山上怎么活**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:54
msgid "攀登之后：把经验炼成心法"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:56
msgid "爬完两座山，你的装备包里塞满了具体技术——卷积、跳跃连接、通道注意力、深度可分离卷积。但下次面对一座全新的山，你该怎么选装备？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`架构心法 <model-architecture-design/index>` "
"把经验升维为原则：感受野、深度连接、注意力、效率——四个维度，四个旋钮。不是\"加哪个模块\"，而是\"面对新任务时怎么判断该加什么\"。它以**登山者笔记**收尾——回望三十年的路，提炼出可以带走的智慧。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:62
msgid "攀登路线"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:78
msgid "出发"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:80
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../../math-fundamentals/index` "
"给了你理论——计算图、反向传播、梯度下降。登山上篇是这些理论的**实战延伸**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`computational-graph` → PyTorch 自动求导"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:83
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`activation-functions` → ReLU 和 Softmax 的实际表现"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`back-propagation` → `loss.backward()` 的魔法"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:85
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`gradient-descent` → `optimizer.step()` 的参数更新"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:87
msgid "系紧鞋带。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/introduction.md:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`practice-peak/index`——走。"
msgstr ""

